Subject: [PATCH] Add GA4, Search Console, sitemap, and IndexNow support

- Inject analytics tags into all generated pages and root index.html
- Use dynamic lastmod in sitemap generation
- Add IndexNow key file and GitHub Action
- Pass analytics secrets through GitHub Pages deploy workflow
